<h2>General Blender Info</h2>

When you first open Bkender you might be intimidated. Yes this is a professional software. So there are a lot of options. buttons and in general things to see. But lets go it through one by one:
First the big part eith the 3-Dimensional Grid, a Cube (in the Blender community often refered as the evil default cube) and two strange objcts out of wire (a camera and a point light source). On the right is a bar, wich is split in two: a objects list (this shows all objects in your "scene"). Here we find the now known three objects: Camera (Camera icon), Cube (Mesh icon) and Light (pooint light source icon). Thats the most iportant for now. 
